{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Optimization.LPWeakDuality","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Optimization.LPWeakDuality","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Ring.Finset","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.BigOperators.Group.Finset","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.lp_duality_gap_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.lp_duality_gap_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LPWeakDuality.lean#L113-L124","doc":"**The LP duality gap is non-negative.** For any primal-feasible `x` and\ndual-feasible `λ`, `0 ≤ dualityGap c x a l = primalObj c x − dualObj a l`. This\nis the proved statement standing behind the `duality_gap ≥ 0` assertion in every\nQOU LP/SDP-dual witness. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.lp_weak_duality","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.lp_weak_duality","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LPWeakDuality.lean#L82-L111","doc":"**LP weak duality.** For any primal-feasible `x` and dual-feasible `λ`, the\ndual objective bounds the primal objective from below:\n`∑ᵢ aᵢ λᵢ ≤ ∑ⱼ cⱼ xⱼ`.\n\nProof: substitute `aᵢ = ∑ⱼ Aᵢⱼ xⱼ`, swap the order of summation, factor out `xⱼ`\nto reach `∑ⱼ (∑ᵢ λᵢ Aᵢⱼ) xⱼ`, then bound each term using the dual inequality\n`∑ᵢ λᵢ Aᵢⱼ ≤ cⱼ` and `xⱼ ≥ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.dualityGap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.dualityGap","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LPWeakDuality.lean#L77-L80","doc":"The duality gap `primalObj − dualObj`. Its non-negativity is the content of\n`lp_duality_gap_nonneg`; equality would be *strong* duality (not claimed here). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.dualObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.dualObj","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LPWeakDuality.lean#L74-L75","doc":"The dual objective `∑ᵢ aᵢ λᵢ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.primalObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.primalObj","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LPWeakDuality.lean#L71-L72","doc":"The primal objective `∑ⱼ cⱼ xⱼ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.DualFeasible.le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.DualFeasible.le","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LPWeakDuality.lean#L69-L69","doc":"The dual inequality `λᵀ A ≤ c`, one per column `j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.DualFeasible.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.DualFeasible.mk","kind":"ctor","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LPWeakDuality.lean#L66-L66","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.DualFeasible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.DualFeasible","kind":"structure","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LPWeakDuality.lean#L64-L69","doc":"Dual feasibility for the Lagrangian dual `max aᵀλ  s.t.  λᵀ A ≤ c`:\nthe column constraint `λᵀ A ≤ c` holds column-wise. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.PrimalFeasible.nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.PrimalFeasible.nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LPWeakDuality.lean#L62-L62","doc":"Non-negativity of the primal variables. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.PrimalFeasible.eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.PrimalFeasible.eq","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LPWeakDuality.lean#L60-L60","doc":"The equality constraints `A x = a`, one per row `i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.PrimalFeasible.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.PrimalFeasible.mk","kind":"ctor","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LPWeakDuality.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.PrimalFeasible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.PrimalFeasible","kind":"structure","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LPWeakDuality.lean#L55-L62","doc":"Primal feasibility for the standard-form LP `min cᵀx  s.t.  A x = a, x ≥ 0`:\nthe equality constraints `A x = a` hold row-wise and `x` is non-negative. ","signatureChunk":0}]}